{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39951","headline":"醉题邑宰南塘屋壁 · 徐夤","name":"醉题邑宰南塘屋壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万古清淮照远天，黄河浊浪不相关。\n县留东道三千客，宅锁南塘一片山。\n草色净经秋雨绿，烧痕寒入晓窗斑。\n闽王美锦求贤制，未许陶公解印还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}